    <statement><p>Given that <m>f(-7) = -8</m> and <m>f'(-7) = -2</m>, approximate
<m>f(-6.9)</m>.</p>
<p><m>f(-6.9) \approx</m> <fillin characters="6" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-8.2</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><alert> Solution:</alert> 



Using the formula, <m>f(c + h) \approx f(c) + f'(c)\cdot h</m>,
<me>f(-6.9) = f(-7 + 0.1) \approx f(-7) + f'(-7)\cdot (0.1)
  = -8  - 2 \cdot (0.1) = -8.2.</me>


</solution>
